# Only the engine's sources go into an image build (deploy/rendezvous); never the install, _local or build output.
*
!engine/Cargo.toml
!engine/Cargo.lock
!engine/crates
!engine/vendor
**/target

# The browser image (deploy/web) needs the version file and the page too.
!VERSION
!web/index.html
!web/main.js
!deploy/web
